pm_touch_update_scroll(a0, a1, a2) is updateScroll(maxScroll, lineScroll, stepSize); a0 is maxScroll, a2 is stepSize. The ulong&amp; reference parameter becomes the out-pointer a1: the current lineScroll is read from and written back through it. Returns true when the view changed.
pm_touch_get_scroll_vector() is getScrollVector(). Returns the signed movement of the most recent pad step, 0 when idle.
